Design a premium futuristic deep-tech startup website using the following strict color system.

Color System

Primary: Deep black background

Brand Color: Electric blue

Accent Color: Teal / emerald green (for highlights and interactions)

Text: White for readability

Color Usage Rules

Black should dominate the layout (70% usage)

Electric blue used for branding, gradients, glow effects, headings, borders, and active elements

Teal / emerald green used as accent for CTAs, highlights, hover states, success states, and important interactions

White used for text and contrast

Avoid random colors — only use black, blue, teal/emerald, and white

Example Color Values

Black: #000000 / #0A0A0A

Electric Blue: #2563EB or #3B82F6

Teal: #14B8A6

Emerald: #10B981

White: #FFFFFF

